LICENSE — Europe 1914 boundaries (ohm_1914_europe)

This dataset combines two license regimes. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the
full attribution record.

1. OpenHistoricalMap base data: Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
   public domain dedication ("unless noted otherwise"), per
   https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/OpenHistoricalMap/License.
   CC0 text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

2. CC BY 4.0 segments: 273 member ways (IGN CNIG Spain, Kartverket
   Norway, eProstor Slovenia, UN OCHA HDX) under Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International.
   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Commercial use, modification and redistribution are permitted under
both regimes. The CC BY 4.0 segments require attribution (see
ATTRIBUTION.md) and a link to the license. No NonCommercial,
ShareAlike or NoDerivatives element is present in this extract
(per-element license-tag check, 2026-11-12).
